{% style %}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
    padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.color_background }};
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
      padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}
{{ 'em-manual.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<div class="em-wrap">
  <section class="em-ch em-ch-section" id="care" style="scroll-margin-top:180px">
    <p class="em-ch__num">06 · Care</p>
    <h2>Cleaning, care and travel</h2>
    <p class="em-ch__lead">Let it cool, keep the battery dry, and it lasts.</p>
    <div class="em-faq">
      <details id="q-cleaning">
        <summary>Cleaning and care</summary>
        <div class="em-faq__a">
          <ol>
            <li><b>Chamber.</b> Let the unit cool fully, then wipe the chamber clean. Never pour water into a hot chamber.</li>
            <li><b>Vaporshaft.</b> Use the long brush with warm water — scrub up and down through the shaft.</li>
            <li><b>Airpaths.</b> Insert the short brush into each individual airpath tube.</li>
            <li><b>Dip tube.</b> Pull the dip tube and watershield out of the rubber housing, rinse under warm water, and reinsert.</li>
          </ol>
          <p>Blowout valve: remove and rinse with water every 1–2 uses.</p>
          <p>Rinse cups after every session; do the full routine every 3–5 bowls.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details id="q-cs-clean-pack">
        <summary>Cleaning and packing: what to do, what never to do</summary>
        <div class="em-faq__a">
          <ol>
            <li>Let the device cool completely before any cleaning — 30 to 45 minutes.</li>
            <li>Soak the ceramic cup in warm water with a mild detergent right after a session. It is dishwasher-safe.</li>
            <li>Clean the heating chamber with the multi-tool at normal, gentle pressure, or a round sponge that fits inside. No force.</li>
            <li>When packing, poke holes through the tobacco with the poking tool.</li>
            <li>Never pry against the mouthpiece tube or the water-filter joint — that is how it breaks.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details id="q-cs-water-in-device">
        <summary>Keeping water out of the device</summary>
        <div class="em-faq__a">
          <p>Water belongs in the tank and nowhere else. Do not fill past the mark, keep the body dry, and let everything air-dry before reassembly. If water has got into the body, stop using it, let it dry fully and send support a video — a genuine fault is covered.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details id="q-travel">
        <summary>Travel and flights</summary>
        <div class="em-faq__a">
          <p>ENSŌ is airline-friendly — the 55Wh battery is well below the 100Wh carry-on limit.</p>
          <p>Before flying: empty the water tank, remove the battery, keep batteries in cabin luggage (never checked bags).</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details id="q-cs-dimensions">
        <summary>Size, weight and shipping</summary>
        <div class="em-faq__a">
          <p>Boxed, it is roughly 33 × 12 cm and about 2.55 kg. That size and weight is also why express and priority mail are not offered — standard courier only.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details id="q-cs-discreet">
        <summary>Is the packaging discreet?</summary>
        <div class="em-faq__a">
          <p>Yes. It ships in a plain outer box with a small sticker and no prominent branding.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "EM: Cleaning & Care",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "color_background",
      "label": "Background",
      "default": "#faf8f4"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding top (desktop)",
      "default": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding bottom (desktop)",
      "default": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top_mobile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding top (mobile)",
      "default": 40
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom_mobile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding bottom (mobile)",
      "default": 40
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "EM: Cleaning & Care"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
